[{"description":"Ali Plumb – that movie bloke off the internet with the interviews and the specs and the beard – is taking his delightfully nerdy film quiz on the road again… and you should definitely come. Taking place INSIDE YOUR FAVOURITE CINEMA with an ACTUAL CINEMA SCREEN (fancy!), he'll be taking his suitcase full of prizes and brain full of silly film-related questions to your local picture house. What should you expect, you wonder? Think 'Guess the film from the Lego minifigure', 'Where's Wally?' but with Paddington and an absolute belter of a big-screen video observation round, trust us. \r\n\r\nSo if you know your Batman from your One Battle After Another, your Spielberg from your Cronenberg, your Disney from your Pixar (okay, Disney•Pixar), join Ali Plumb for an evening of spot prizes, absurd music rounds, perplexing motion picture puzzles and the occasional half-decent joke as he clumsily, amiably, enthusiastically asks you questions that’ll make you go, “Oh I know this one!” or “Argh, I nearly know this one!” You know, in a fun way.\r\n\r\nMax. 5 people per team.\r\n\r\nPlease note that this quiz is the same as those put on in the rest of Ali's tour - for more info, head to his website: https://linktr.ee/aliplumb\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":180,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Ali Plumb's Untitled Film Quiz Project","instanceDates":"22 November-22 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"273401AHBRSVBJMQPGPGQQMJNRVPPBPTP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-22T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-22T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-22T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-22T19:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Special Events","attribute_Film":false,"attribute_FilmDuration":"180","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":true,"attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_DirectedBy":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre1":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_Year":"","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"","attribute_Distributor":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"When a tidemark of poisoned crabs & lobsters devastates a small North East fishing town in England, veteran fisherman Stan Rennie becomes the unlikeliest of activists. A wry David and Goliath story, told with gallows humour and a strong local accent, about the grief of navigating a world which has suddenly, inexplicably changed forever.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":123,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"All Rivers Spill Their Stories to the Sea","instanceDates":"23 October-29 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"289801ALTKJSQMDCSTNLTPJCBBTPPGKKG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-23T17:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-23T16:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-29T20:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-29T20:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Jeanie Finlay","attribute_Distributor":"Jeanie Finlay","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"103","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_Genre1":"Documentary","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"When a tidemark of poisoned crabs & lobsters devastates a small North East fishing town in England, veteran fisherman Stan Rennie becomes the unlikeliest of activists. A wry David and Goliath story, told with gallows humour and a strong local accent, about the grief of navigating a world which has suddenly, inexplicably changed forever.\r\nFollowed by a Q&A with director Jeanie Finlay\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":119,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"All Rivers Spill Their Stories to the Sea + Q&A","instanceDates":"12 October-12 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"282401ACMMJJVMCSDTMRDRDQLDGPTKLRS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-12T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-12T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-12T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-12T19:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Jeanie Finlay","attribute_Distributor":"Glimmerama","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Special Events","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"99","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_Genre1":"Documentary","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Mary Norton's popular story, The Borrowers, gets the Studio Ghibli treatment, with all the beauty and charm of the studio’s films.\r\nArrietty's family are Borrowers - tiny people who quietly liberate their human neighbour's everyday objects and find alternative uses for them. But when Arrietty is discovered by Sho, a human boy, a new friendship blossoms, threatening their peaceful existence. \r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":95,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Arrietty  (Dubbed) - Relaxed Screening","instanceDates":"22 October-22 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"292201AKRTDNPTVTQSPSHMHMMMNMKCCLG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T17:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T16:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T17:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T16:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Mirai Shida, Ryûnosuke Kamiki, Tatsuya Fujiwara ","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Japan","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Hiromasa Yonebayashi","attribute_Distributor":"Anime Ltd","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"95","attribute_FilmRating":"U","attribute_Genre1":"Animation","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2011","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Mary Norton's popular story, The Borrowers, gets the Studio Ghibli treatment, with all the beauty and charm of the studio’s films.\r\nArrietty's family are Borrowers - tiny people who quietly liberate their human neighbour's everyday objects and find alternative uses for them. But when Arrietty is discovered by Sho, a human boy, a new friendship blossoms, threatening their peaceful existence.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":115,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Arrietty (Dubbed)","instanceDates":"17 October-18 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"288601ANKDTLNSQPSCBDBRCDCBDLKTDJC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T14:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T13:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T14:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T13:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Saoirse Ronan, Tom Holland, Olivia Colman","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Japan","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Hiromasa Yonebayashi","attribute_Distributor":"Anime Ltd","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"95","attribute_FilmRating":"U","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2011","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre1":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Mary Norton's popular story, The Borrowers, gets the Studio Ghibli treatment, with all the beauty and charm of the studio’s films.\r\nArrietty's family are Borrowers - tiny people who quietly liberate their human neighbour's everyday objects and find alternative uses for them. But when Arrietty is discovered by Sho, a human boy, a new friendship blossoms, threatening their peaceful existence.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":115,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Arrietty (Subtitled)","instanceDates":"16 October-16 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"288801ATVNJDMJKGMRVPLNHRPPBLBPGPT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T18:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T17:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T17:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Mirai Shida, Ryûnosuke Kamiki, Tatsuya Fujiwara","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Japan","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Hiromasa Yonebayashi","attribute_Distributor":"Anime Ltd","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"95","attribute_FilmRating":"U","attribute_Language":"Japanese with English Subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2011","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre1":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"A jaded New York club promoter finds his messy lifestyle upended by the discovery that he has a son in the hotly anticipated debut feature from actor, writer and internet personality Jordan Firstman – one of the most talked about films at this year’s Cannes Film Festival.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":142,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"BFI London Film Festival 2026: Club Kid","instanceDates":"18 October-18 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"284201ADJVTTDVLGQTCSLQBTGTDLHMGST","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T16:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T15:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Jordan Firstman, Diego Calva","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Jordan Firstman","attribute_Distributor":"A24","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"BFI London Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"122","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Comedy","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Indie darlings Sebanstian Stan and Renate Reinsve star in director Cristian Mungui’s second Palme d’Or winner after 4 Months, 3 Weeks and 2 Days. A devout couple relocate to a close-knit coastal town with their five children. When allegations of abuse emerge, the pair are forced to confront a system of judgement that blurs the line between concern and prejudice.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":166,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"BFI London Film Festival 2026: Fjord","instanceDates":"17 October-17 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"283202AVNCTCCPDCJCKSJCSQHGNSPTTJG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T16:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T15:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Renata Reinsve, Sebastian Stan","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Romania/Norway","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Cristian Mungiu","attribute_Distributor":"Picturehouse","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"BFI London Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"146","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_Language":"English and Romanian, Norwegian and Swedish with English subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Danny Boyle directs an all-star cast featuring Jack O’Connell, Guy Pearce and Claire Foy in an explosive cinematic rollercoaster. Adapted by James Graham from his 2017 stage play, Ink recounts how Rupert Murdoch made The Sun one of the most successful newspapers in British history.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":136,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"BFI London Film Festival 2026: Ink","instanceDates":"13 October-13 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"283401ABCMNPTCSRQKBHLQQLSHNRGLRDM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-13T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-13T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-13T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-13T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Jack O’Connell, Guy Pearce","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Danny Boyle","attribute_Distributor":"Studio Canal","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"BFI London Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"116","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Featuring brilliant performances from Channing Tatum and Gemma Chan, Josephine is a taut and devastating drama that follows a child trying to navigate life after witnessing a sexual assault. Weaving thriller and horror conventions into a serious, sobering scenario, director Beth Araújo creates an often uncomfortable yet vital film that interrogates how we explain the unspeakable.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":139,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"BFI London Film Festival 2026: Josephine","instanceDates":"14 October-14 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"283601ANDLHBJCDDDTLBRKLBTVCLBSLTD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-14T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-14T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-14T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-14T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Channing Tatum, Gemma Chan","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Beth de Araújo","attribute_Distributor":"Curzon Artificial Eye","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"BFI London Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"119","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"A glimpse behind the scenes of the making of Sofia Coppola’s Oscar-winning 2006 period drama, by documentarian Eleanor Coppola (Hearts of Darkness). Edited from 80 hours of footage,with Diane Lane reading passages from the late filmmaker’s journals from her time on set, the project was assembled to fulfil Eleanor’s wish that the material be turned into a feature-length documentary.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":105,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"BFI London Film Festival 2026: Making Marie Antoinette","instanceDates":"15 October-15 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"283801AQSNJHQPGPBHBGSDNRKQCDGNSHJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-15T18:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-15T17:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-15T18:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-15T17:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Eleanor Coppola","attribute_Distributor":"MUBI","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"BFI London Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"85","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Documentary","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Andry Zvyagintsev transposes Claude Chabrol’s classic La Femme Infidèle to contemporary Russia, delivering a magnificent political allegory that dissects the mechanics of ego, violence and corruption. Nine years after LFF winner Loveless, the director returns with a masterful and darkly humorous tale of impunity that will make your blood run cold.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":161,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"BFI London Film Festival 2026: Minotaur","instanceDates":"16 October-16 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"284001AHJSCVQLCTCJKVNRPGJSNKDBBLC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Dmitriy Mazurov, Iris Lebedeva","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"France/Latvia/Germany","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Andrey Zvyagintsev","attribute_Distributor":"MUBI","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"BFI London Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"141","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_Language":"Russian with English subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Writer/director Jesse Eisenberg (A Real Pain) returns with another deliriously funny and heartfelt film, this time starring the brilliant Julianne Moore as a shy woman unexpectedly cast in a local production of an original musical. Under the spell of the strong-willed director (Paul Giomatti), she loses herself in the role and the high-stakes world of community theatre production.  ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":125,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"BFI London Film Festival 2026: The Debut","instanceDates":"19 October-19 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"283602AGBKQCCJKPTKQCRVVHBDCVMPPQC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-19T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-19T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-19T19:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-19T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Julianne Moore, Paul Giamatti","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Jesse Eisenberg","attribute_Distributor":"Lionsgate","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"BFI London Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"105","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_Genre2":"Comedy","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Ten years after the passing of the legendary artist and icon David Bowie and celebrating the 50th anniversary of the release of his first major film role, The Man Who Fell to Earth, this talk focuses on the fascinating but arguably lesser-known history of The Thin White Duke’s film and TV career. We welcome back Adrian Wootton, CEO of Film London, very old friend (and founder director) of Broadway to give one of his inimitable, lively presentations revealing the many surprising, funny and little-known stories behind the greatest moments of Bowie’s onscreen career, replete with a jamboree of clips and slide images. \r\n\r\n+ The Man Who Fell to Earth - Re-release Preview \r\n\r\nDavid Bowie‘s first major starring role saw him  playing with otherworldly authenticity Thomas Newton, an alien sent to Earth to try and save his own water-starved planet. Based on Walter Tevis’s classic prescient novel, this is one of the great dystopian sci-fi films that is also a scathing satire of 1970’s America, tinged with the paranoia and conspiracy thriller politics of the Watergate era. Brilliantly directed by Nicolas Roeg, one of our best but often unfairly neglected British filmmakers, this was a commercial disaster on first release but has since been rightfully recognised as a genuine masterpiece.\r\n\r\nSchedule\r\nIllustrated talk 6pm - 7.30pm\r\nBreak 7.30pm - 7.45pm\r\nFilm 7.45pm - 10.10pm (approx.)\r\n\r\n\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":229,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Bowie on the Silver Screen: An Illustrated Talk by Adrian Wootton + The Man Who Fell to Earth","instanceDates":"11 November-11 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"296001AGTCTVLCKRHNHDLVCVDMBGDCLMS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-11T18:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-11T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-11T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-11T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"David Bowie, Candy Clark, Rip Torn","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Nicolas Roeg","attribute_Distributor":"Studio Canal","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"139","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Cult Film","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1976","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"British punk duo Sleaford Mods have been called \"the voice of Britain\" by their fans, \"Britain's angriest band\" by the Guardian and \"The world's greatest rock 'n' roll band\" by Iggy Pop. Bunch of Kunst: A film about Sleaford Mods follows them on their two-year journey from Nottingham bedroom recording sessions to chart success. \r\n \r\nWith an introduction by Ben Welch, Hockley Hustle.\r\n \r\nThis screening is presented by our friends, Hockley Hustle as part of their 25th Anniversary celebrations in collaboration with Emmanuel House. 50% of the profits of the screening will be donated to Emmanuel House.\r\n \r\nTo find out more about the festival and to book tickets, visit: www.hockleyhustle.co.uk:\r\n\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":112,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Bunch of Kunst - A Film About Sleaford Mods + Introduction","instanceDates":"20 October-20 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"291201APHJJPQMQPHJPQNPMNCGBTKNCMK","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-20T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-20T18:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-20T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-20T18:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Christine Franz","attribute_Distributor":"Magnet Films","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Special Events","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"102","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Documentary","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2017","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"In the midst of mass protests in Paris, an internal affairs police officer investigates a case involving a man seriously injured in police gunfire during a tense “gilets jaunes” protest. Even with no hard evidence of illegal police action, the case becomes personal after she learns the victim is from her own hometown.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":135,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Case 137","instanceDates":"16 October-22 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"288201AQHGLKJDKMVJLSVGPHRSNVMHNKG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T20:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T19:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T20:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Léa Drucker, Jonathan Turnbull, Mathilde Roehrich","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"France","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Dominik Moll","attribute_Distributor":"Conic","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"115","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_Language":"French with English subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2025","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Bertrand Usclat and Martin Darondeau’s award-winning backstage comedy is set inside the world’s oldest active theatre company. This gleeful farce follows producer Nina as she battles mounting chaos just hours before the opening night of Shakespeare’s Macbeth. \r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":95,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Comédie Française","instanceDates":"16 October-22 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"291801ATSDJTSMSPRVRPLNRHTQGCVPRCP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T16:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T15:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T18:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T17:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Pauline Clément, Laurent Stocker, Julien Frison","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"France","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Bertrand Usclat and Martin Darondeau","attribute_Distributor":"Tull Stories","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"75","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Comedy","attribute_Language":"French with English Subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2025","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Join us for a night of classic television and live conversation. We're delighted to welcome back to Broadway Comic Strip genius Peter Richardson who will be joined on stage by legendary actor and comedian Phil Cornwall.\r\n\r\nEvent Schedule:\r\n\r\n6.30pm – 8.05pm Programme Part 1\r\n\r\nBEST OF RIK MAYAL10 mins\r\nFeaturing  clips from BAD NEWS.,MR JOLLY  and FISTFUL OF TRAVELLERS CHEQUES\r\n\r\nTHE SUPERGRASS (new Director’s Cut) 82 mins\r\nThe hit Comic Strip Movie. Dennis Carter (Ade Edmondson), a young fantasist attempting to impress his wayward girlfriend that he’s an international drug smuggler, is arrested by police and used as a pawn in their search for a real gang. Also starring Peter Richardson, Jennifer Saunders, Robbie Coltrane and Alexei Sayle\r\n\r\n8.05pm – 8.25pm Interval\r\n\r\n8.25pm – 8.50pm Programme Part 2\r\n\r\nBEST OF STELLA STREET 25 mins\r\nScenes from the hit BBC series starring PHIL CORNWELL and JOHN SESSIONS\r\n\r\n8.50pm – 9.30pm LIVE Q&A with PETER RICHARDSON and PHIL CORNWELL\r\n\r\n9.30pm – 10pm Programme Part 3\r\n\r\nFOUR MEN IN A PLANE 30 mins\r\nFour men attending a conference in North Africa avoid a 14-hour bus ride by hiring a small plane which crash-lands in the burning hot desert. The four, unable to fly, attempt to drive the plane like a car back to civilisation. Starring Rik Mayal, Ade Edmondson, Peter Richardson and Nigel Planer\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":225,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Comic Strip Presents... Screening + Q&A with Peter Richardson and Phil Cornwell","instanceDates":"4 November-4 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"262801AHSTTHCVQCTJGPBNLSHTLKLQPDT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-04T18:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-04T18:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-04T18:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-04T18:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Peter Richardson","attribute_Distributor":"Rebecca Carrigan","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Special Events","attribute_Film":false,"attribute_FilmDuration":"225","attribute_FilmRating":"UC","attribute_Genre1":"Comedy","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":true,"attribute_Year":"Various","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Mary Norton's popular story, The Borrowers, gets the Studio Ghibli treatment, with all the beauty and charm of the studio’s films.\r\nArrietty's family are Borrowers - tiny people who quietly liberate their human neighbour's everyday objects and find alternative uses for them. But when Arrietty is discovered by Sho, a human boy, a new friendship blossoms, threatening their peaceful existence. \r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":95,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Cosy Craft Cinema: Arrietty (Dubbed)","instanceDates":"19 October-19 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"292001ALNJVNJSCDMRJDKNLGQDDNQRBSK","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-19T18:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-19T17:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-19T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-19T17:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Mirai Shida, Ryûnosuke Kamiki, Tatsuya Fujiwara ","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Japan","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Hiromasa Yonebayashi ","attribute_Distributor":"Anime Ltd","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"95","attribute_FilmRating":"U","attribute_Genre1":"Animation","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2011","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"In this second part of a two-part WW2 biographical drama, Charles De Gaulle stands against both enemies and allies in his fight for French freedom and sovereignty.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":179,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"De Gaulle: Liberté","instanceDates":"9 October-12 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"292602AJDKJHJJCLRCDRBDGPJSVPLPMPG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-09T13:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-09T12:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-12T13:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-12T12:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Simon Abkarian, Niels Schneider, Anamaria Vartolomei","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"France","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Antonin Baudry","attribute_Distributor":"Entertainment","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"159","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_Language":"French with English Subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"On Christmas Eve, tough New York detective John McClane arrives in LA with the aim of reconciling with his estranged wife at her work Christmas party. But his plans go awry when the party is disrupted by a group of heavily armed criminals led by the charismatic Hans Gruber. It’s a holiday classic – Bruce Willis in a sweaty vest working overtime to save Christmas – what more could you want?","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":152,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/broadwaynottingham/files/eb205b4e-23b1-4b71-b1e2-5786f5296ff2.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Die Hard","instanceDates":"18 December-17 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/broadwaynottingham/files/eb205b4e-23b1-4b71-b1e2-5786f5296ff2-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"10601APSKMRRDLKDGKBKNPNLTDRGCSHLR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2025-12-18T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2025-12-18T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-17T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-17T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Bruce Willis, Alan Rickman","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"John McTiernan","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Christmas","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"132","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Cult Film","attribute_Genre2":"Action","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1988","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Digger stars Tom Cruise as Digger Rockwell, a larger-than-life power broker whose actions trigger a global catastrophe. Faced with the consequences of his own decisions, he embarks on a desperate mission to convince the world that he can still save humanity before everything unravels around him. Directed by Oscar-winner Alejandro G. Iñárritu (Birdman, The Revenant), Digger blends dark comedy, political satire and high-stakes drama into one of the most unusual films of Tom Cruise’s career. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":149,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Digger","instanceDates":"2 October-15 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"288001AGPPQSPPCCPSVJJKCDMHTGTSQCN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-02T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-02T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-15T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-15T18:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":true,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Tom Cruise, Emma D’Arcy, Sandra Huller","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"US","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":" Alejandro Gonzalez Inarritu","attribute_Distributor":"Warners","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"129","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_Genre2":"Comedy","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"To celebrate Doctor Who Day, the acclaimed two-part adventure The Impossible Planet and The\r\nSatan Pit have been specially re-edited into a single movie-length presentation, created\r\nexclusively for theatrical audiences.\r\n\r\nAds and trailers will begin at 18:40 - the film will start promptly at 19:00","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":119,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Doctor Who: The Satan Pit","instanceDates":"23 November-23 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"291001AMJTJGCPDPBQCHLSQKKQLVLLGJN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-23T18:40:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-23T18:40:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-23T18:40:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-23T18:40:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_Distributor":"Cinema Live","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Special Events","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"119","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_Genre1":"Sci-Fi","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_DirectedBy":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_Year":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"The original Candyman asks who created urban legends; the 2021 sequel asks who is erased from history and what stories survive that erasure. \r\nThe campfire tale of the ‘Candyman’ explores trauma, holds up a mirror to society and tells stories of all too-realistic injustices that happened in Cabrini Green. Chicago’s architecture and equally rich Black heritage serve as a backdrop to setting and subtext alike, Tony Todd is widely regarded as one of THE Black horror household names, and this Candyman double-bill is a wonderful way to honour his legacy this Black History Month.\r\nThere will be a 30 minute interval between films.\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":236,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Double-bill: Candyman (1992 & 2021)","instanceDates":"1 November-1 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"284802AGPRHNCKTCPCHHJCNMJTGGTQNNH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-01T18:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-01T18:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-01T18:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-01T18:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Virginia Madsen, Tony Todd / Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Teyonah Parris","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Bernard Rose / Nia DaCosta","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Horror Noire","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"99min / 87","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1992 / 2021","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"One Christmas Eve a long time ago, a baby crawled into Santa’s bag of toys… Raised as an elf, Buddy grows into an adult three times larger than his friends. Realising he will never truly fit in at the North Pole, Buddy sets off to find his true place in the world – in New York City. There he realises his destiny: to save Christmas for New York and the world.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":117,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/broadwaynottingham/files/2587253f-dc71-4d74-93bc-ee450c86b7eb.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Elf","instanceDates":"20 December-24 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/broadwaynottingham/files/2587253f-dc71-4d74-93bc-ee450c86b7eb-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"10402ARDVDMNJBRVPDTKLPJMKVHLCQLDV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2025-12-20T13:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2025-12-20T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-24T11:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-24T11:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Will Ferrell, James Caan, Zooey Deschanel","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Jon Favreau","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Christmas","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"97","attribute_FilmRating":"PG","attribute_Genre1":"Cult Film","attribute_Genre2":"Children","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2003","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"To celebrate Tate Britain’s blockbuster Monet and Time exhibition, Exhibition on Screen is delighted to bring the iconic story of Claude Monet to cinema screens in May 2027. Details are still to be fully confirmed for this title, but this will be an unmissable opportunity for audiences to be dazzled by Monet’s spectacular and revolutionary use of light and colour and marvel at one of the world’s favourite artists.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Exhibition on Screen: Monet","instanceDates":"17 May-17 May","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"248203ANBPPQHLNVMDKQGTTBLRQRJSGMV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-17T15:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-17T14:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-17T17:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-17T16:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"TBC","attribute_Distributor":"Seventh Art Productions","attribute_EventCinema":true,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Exhibition on Screen","attribute_Film":false,"attribute_FilmDuration":"90","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Event Cinema","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Pierre-Auguste Renoir is one of the world’s favourite artists, a founding member of the Impressionist movement and a constantly evolving artist. With exclusive access to the National Gallery’s new exciting show of the same name (3 October 2026 – 31 January 2027), Exhibition on Screen will bring Renoir’s world class works to cinema audiences. Be transported back to a Parisian summer of love through the eyes of a true visionary. An unmissable opportunity to fall in love with Renoir this winter.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":110,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Exhibition on Screen: Renoir & Love","instanceDates":"25 January-25 January","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"248202AKDCPJQBLLGTGBVMTMGHCMKPDKP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-25T15:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-25T15:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-25T17:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-25T17:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Ali Ray","attribute_Distributor":"Seventh Art Productions","attribute_EventCinema":true,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Exhibition on Screen","attribute_Film":false,"attribute_FilmDuration":"90","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Event Cinema","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_Year":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"In their final year at boarding school in the early 2000s, two best friends with their own shared language and offbeat ideas about growing up set themselves the task of falling in love with their geography teacher. Two breakout star turns from Galaxie Clear and Marni Duggan and a vivid sense of time and place set the stage in Molly Manners delightful exploration of female friendship and adolescent intimacy. Fresh, charming and original, this is a freewheeling and richly realised coming of age comedy drama with distinct personality and tone. – EIFF","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":114,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Extra Geography","instanceDates":"9 October-15 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"287201ADSJSDCQVBTSQQDBHJJGDKRMCPJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-09T17:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-09T16:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-15T17:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-15T16:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Marni Duggan, Galaxie Clear, Aoife Riddell","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Molly Manners","attribute_Distributor":"Vertigo","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"94","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2025","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Nominated for 5 Tony Awards, this acclaimed revival of Noël Coward’s champagne-fresh comedy of band manners, shocked and delighted audiences at its 1925 premiere. Two upper-class wives, their husbands away for the day, share a few toasts to their pre-marital dalliances, when old rivalries and past scandals bubble to the surface.\r\n'If you’re looking for pure escapist fun to provide some immediate relief, Fallen Angels can’t be beat’ – The New York Times\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Fallen Angels","instanceDates":"22 October-25 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"277001AHHGNTPSJCHHDLHMQSCDPVDNGTD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-22T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-22T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-25T13:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-25T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Rose Byrne, Kelli O'Hara","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Scott Ellis","attribute_Distributor":"Trafalgar Releasing","attribute_EventCinema":true,"attribute_Film":false,"attribute_FilmDuration":"110","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Event Cinema","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"In 1949, Erika (a superb Sandra Hüller) is accompanying her father, Nobel laureate author Thomas Mann, on a literary tour through West and East Germany. As family tragedy strikes, it becomes apparent that the spiritual healing Mann deems essential for the divided country may be necessary for their own relationship. It’s an impeccably shot and evocative drama that meditates on the healing process for a fractured national identity. [BFI]","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":102,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Fatherland","instanceDates":"23 October-29 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"289401AMGVQNPSMSNLHSVVTTSPBJLLVTV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-23T15:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-23T14:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-29T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-29T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Sandra Huller, Hanns Zischler, August Diehl","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Poland/Germany","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Paweł Pawlikowski","attribute_Distributor":"MUBI","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"82","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_Genre1":"Drama","attribute_Genre2":"Foreign","attribute_Language":"English, German, French and Russian with English subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Touring programme of artists' work shortlisted for the Jarman Award 2026. Hosted in collaboration with Nottingham Contemporary. Includes a discussion and q&a with artists Rhea Storr and Alia Sayed chaired by Angelica Sule, Director of Film and Video Umbrella.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":180,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Film London Jarman Award 2026","instanceDates":"8 November-8 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"294601AGCSKNPCHDRJJVHLDPBPGRPKRVL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-08T18:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-08T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-08T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-08T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":true,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":false,"attribute_FilmDuration":"180","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Art","attribute_Genre2":"Documentary","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_DirectedBy":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_Distributor":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Chris and his girlfriend Rose go upstate to visit her parents for the weekend. Although they seem normal at first, he is not prepared to experience the horrors ahead.\r\nJordan Peele’s modern classic critiques ‘liberal racism’ and colour-blindness, tackling fetishisation and exploitative attitudes toward Black culture. Daniel Kaluuya’s Chris is invited but not accepted. Get Out references W.E.B. Du Bois’s concept of “twoness”, referring to double-consciousness and the internal psychological conflict of constantly looking at oneself through the eyes of a racist white society, forcing Black Americans to reconcile their identities as both Black and American. \r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Get Out","instanceDates":"23 October-23 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"284401ALQBLGCMMGQSCQGQCLJTQDMHVRQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-23T20:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-23T19:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-23T20:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-23T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Daniel Kaluuya, Alison Williams","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Jordan Peele","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Horror Noire","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"100","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2017","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Three years on from our last visit to Button House, the ghosts are back and adjusting to life without Alison and Mike. When protestors threaten to disrupt the work on the planned hotel, they try to find a way for at least one of them to finally leave the grounds. The hit BBC comedy show returns as a new feature film geared towards old and new audiences alike.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":117,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Ghosts: The Possession of Button House","instanceDates":"23 October-29 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"289201ADNTDBMNHNDVKRNQJLMLVKLTRVN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-23T13:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-23T12:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-29T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-29T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Mathew Baynton, Simon Farnaby, Martha Howe-Douglas","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Simon Hynd","attribute_Distributor":"Lionsgate","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"97","attribute_FilmRating":"PG","attribute_Genre1":"Comedy","attribute_Genre2":"Children","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Three years on from our last visit to Button House, the ghosts are back and adjusting to life without Alison and Mike. When protestors threaten to disrupt the work on the planned hotel, they try to find a way for at least one of them to finally leave the grounds. The hit BBC comedy show returns as a new feature film geared towards old and new audiences alike.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":117,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Ghosts: The Possession of Button House - Parent & Baby","instanceDates":"27 October-27 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"293001ATBGBCHSTKCRRJLRVCHSPSNDHVC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-27T13:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-27T13:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-27T13:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-27T13:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Mathew Baynton, Simon Farnaby, Martha Howe-Douglas","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Simon Hynd","attribute_Distributor":"Lionsgate","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Parent & Baby screenings","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"97","attribute_FilmRating":"PG","attribute_Genre1":"Comedy","attribute_Genre2":"Children","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Three years on from our last visit to Button House, the ghosts are back and adjusting to life without Alison and Mike. When protestors threaten to disrupt the work on the planned hotel, they try to find a way for at least one of them to finally leave the grounds. The hit BBC comedy show returns as a new feature film geared towards old and new audiences alike.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":117,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Ghosts: The Possession of Button House - Relaxed Screening","instanceDates":"24 October-24 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"292801AJVPDCNTVNLSBTMTGKDNHBKPLNG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-24T13:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-24T12:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-24T13:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-24T12:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Mathew Baynton, Simon Farnaby, Martha Howe-Douglas","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Simon Hynd","attribute_Distributor":"Lionsgate","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Relaxed Screenings","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"97","attribute_FilmRating":"PG","attribute_Genre1":"Children","attribute_Genre2":"Comedy","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"GIANT, the 5-star critically acclaimed play starring John Lithgow (Killers of the Flower Moon, The\r\nCrown) as Roald Dahl, comes to the big screen. Winner of 3 Olivier Awards® including Best Play and a\r\nTony Award® for Best Actor in a Play (John Lithgow), the production was filmed live in London’s\r\nWest End ahead of its sold-out Broadway run. The stellar cast includes Aya Cash (The Boys, The\r\nFranchise, You’re the Worst), Elliot Levey (Cold War, Patriots, Good) and Rachael Stirling (The Divine\r\nMrs S).\r\nA world-famous children’s author under threat. A battle of wills in the wake of scandal. And one\r\nchance to make amends...It’s the summer of 1983, The Witches is about to hit the shelves and Roald\r\nDahl is making last-minute edits. But the outcry at his recent, explicitly antisemitic article won’t die\r\ndown. Across a single afternoon at his family home, and rocked by an unexpectedly explosive\r\nconfrontation, Dahl is forced to choose: make a public apology or risk his name and reputation.\r\nInspired by real events, GIANT explores with dark humour the difference between considered\r\nopinion and dangerous rhetoric offering a complicated portrait of a fiendishly charismatic icon.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":136,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Giant - The Play","instanceDates":"19 November-22 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"265801ASDRNQHTQBPMRNVSJDVQRJJNMNS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-19T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-19T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-22T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-22T14:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_Distributor":"Trafalgar Releasing","attribute_EventCinema":true,"attribute_Film":false,"attribute_FilmDuration":"136","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_DirectedBy":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre1":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_Year":"","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Takashi Yamazaki returns to direct the sequel to 2023’s Oscar-winning Godzilla Minus One. Set in 1949, in post-war Japan, and two years after Godzilla’s first attack, the Shikishima family are still only rebuilding their lives when an all-new calamity hits. This film expertly mixes human-level drama with spectacular cinematic action.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":155,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Godzilla Minus Zero","instanceDates":"6 November-12 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"294801ADTCVVSNLDLJBNGNKDQNLLMTLHJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-06T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-06T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-12T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-12T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Ryunosuke Kamiki, Minami Hamabe, Yuki Yamada","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Japan","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Takashi Yamazaki","attribute_Distributor":"Anime Ltd","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"135","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Action","attribute_Genre2":"Foreign","attribute_Language":"Japanese with English Subtitles","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"After a botched heist, a robber is separated from his vulnerable brother, who lands in prison. He must traverse New York City’s hypnotic, sleazy crime underbelly to find bail money. Robert Patterson stars in this race-against-the-clock thriller that gave the Safdie brothers their first Palme d'Or nomination.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":122,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Good Time - Presented by Jackie Treehorn","instanceDates":"3 November-3 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"293401AGBNSPNNSLCTBGLHCJSVRGCDVBD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-03T18:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-03T18:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-03T18:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-03T18:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Robert Pattinson, Benny Safdie, Jennifer Jason Leigh","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"US","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Benny Safdie, Josh Safdie","attribute_Distributor":"Curzon Artificial Eye","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"102","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Crime","attribute_Genre2":"Thriller","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2017","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"All Kevin McCallister wants for Christmas is for his family to disappear. So when he wakes to discover that they have accidentally left for their Christmas trip without him, he does what any kid would do – he parties! But when he learns that two burglars with a Christmas list of their own are working their way up the block, he is forced to defend the family home on his own and sets about decking the halls with ingenious traps to hold the thieves at bay until his relatives return.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":103,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Home Alone","instanceDates":"13 December-12 December","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"107001APCDPPVRLGLJBTJNGBPQJDPNJMQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2025-12-13T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2025-12-13T14:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-12T13:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-12T13:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Chris Columbus","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Christmas","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"103","attribute_FilmRating":"PG","attribute_Genre1":"Children","attribute_Genre2":"Comedy","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1990","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_DirectedBy":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Kevin is back for another serving of chaos in this sequel to the 1990 classic. With the original cast all back in place – Macaulay Culkin as Kevin, alongside Daniel Stern and Joe Pesci as the iconic Wet Bandits – Home Alone 2 sees Kevin lost in the Big Apple, after he accidentally boards a plane to New York as the rest of his family head for Miami. There, he bumps into his old enemies planning to rob an old man’s toy store.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Home Alone 2: Lost in New York","instanceDates":"13 December-12 December","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"107201ALHRSDHBGKRGTBPKHQNTRKCSGBS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2025-12-13T16:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2025-12-13T16:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-12T16:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-12T16:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Macaulay Culkin, Joe Pesci, Daniel Stern","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Chris Columbus","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Christmas","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"120","attribute_FilmRating":"PG","attribute_Genre1":"Children","attribute_Genre2":"Comedy","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1992","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"A rural Korean village is under attack from a mysterious creature laying waste to buildings, vehicles and anyone unfortunate enough to cross its path. Reinforcements have been diverted to battle wildfires and all communication has been cut off. Now it is down to a band of hunters, hapless police and terrified locals to identify the beast and bring it down whilst finding themselves hunted instead. What begins as ignorance plants the seed of disaster, escalating through human conflict into a tragedy of cosmic proportions.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":177,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Hope","instanceDates":"2 October-14 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"286401ATDGSPMCQDBSDKNVBQQBKLSSJQC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-02T17:10:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-02T16:10:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-14T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-14T18:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Hwang Jung-min, Zo In-sung, Alicia Vikander, Michael Fassbender","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"South Korea","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Na Hong-jin","attribute_Distributor":"Picturehouse","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"157","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Action","attribute_Genre2":"Sci-Fi","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Director Boots Riley is back behind the camera after his wildly original first feature Sorry to Bother You back in 2018. No less wild, no less original, I Love Boosters is another anti-capitalist vision, in which a fearless crew of inventive young women turn shoplifting into a radical act of defiance.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":133,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"I Love Boosters","instanceDates":"30 October-5 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"290401AGLTPKHDJTSCBKMGVVMSNVNGTSL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-30T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-30T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-05T20:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-05T20:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Keke Palmer, LaKeith Stanfield","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Boots Riley","attribute_Distributor":"Universal","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"113","attribute_FilmRating":"TBC","attribute_Genre1":"Comedy","attribute_Genre2":"Crime","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Beset with personal and professional problems, George Bailey finds his previously happy life falling apart around him on Christmas Eve. Seeing no way out, George considers suicide from the edge of a bridge – but Clarence, his guardian angel, intervenes and shows George what his beloved hometown of Bedford Falls would be like without him. A Christmas cinema classic which never fails to bring a tear to the eye.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":150,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/broadwaynottingham/files/6ebdd2eb-209b-44eb-8dd8-059c9d3b310d.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"It's A Wonderful Life","instanceDates":"22 December-24 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/broadwaynottingham/files/6ebdd2eb-209b-44eb-8dd8-059c9d3b310d-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"12001ALNGHTPHGCKCMSTDNQBDRDVTJPQB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2025-12-22T13:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2025-12-22T13:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-24T12:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-24T12:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"James Stewart, Donna Reed, Lionel Barrymore","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Frank Capra","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Christmas","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"130","attribute_FilmRating":"U","attribute_Genre1":"Classics","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1946","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Beset with personal and professional problems, George Bailey finds his previously happy life falling apart around him on Christmas Eve. Seeing no way out, George considers suicide from the edge of a bridge – but Clarence, his guardian angel, intervenes and shows George what his beloved hometown of Bedford Falls would be like without him. A Christmas cinema classic which never fails to bring a tear to the eye.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":150,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"It's A Wonderful Life - Pay What You Feel","instanceDates":"23 December-23 December","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"107801ARRRKNVQKNCSKGMCKNBNLTBRRKB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2025-12-23T16:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2025-12-23T16:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-23T13:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-23T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"James Stewart, Donna Reed, Lionel Barrymore","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Frank Capra","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Christmas","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"130","attribute_FilmRating":"U","attribute_Genre1":"Classics","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1946","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Inspired by the true story of 17th-century priest Urbain Grandier, accused of bewitching a convent of nuns, The Devils lays bare the collusion of church and state through a searing vision of religious persecution, collective hysteria and institutional corruption. The restoration many believed would never happen reaffirms Russell’s incendiary masterpiece as among the most overwhelming and uncompromising achievements in British cinema.\r\n\r\nINTRODUCTION - Friday 30 October \r\nKino Klubb's Joey Bell introduces the new 4K director's cut of Ken Russell’s The Devils — uncut, uncensored and unimaginable. One of British cinema’s great unholy visions, Russell’s 1971 fever dream of religious hysteria, sexual repression and institutional power remains as outrageous, disturbing and gloriously excessive as ever.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":134,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Ken Russell's The Devils - 4K Restoration","instanceDates":"30 October-5 November","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"290201AQTGMRPLRCPCKQRKQKRMRCBDDKQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-30T20:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-30T20:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-05T17:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-05T17:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Vanessa Redgrave, Oliver Reed, Dudley Sutton","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"UK","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Ken Russell","attribute_Distributor":"BFI","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"114","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_Genre2":"Drama","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1971","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Kendal Mountain Events returns for another season of adventure and human connection with a film-only event. A handpicked curation of award-winning short films, showcasing breathtaking landscapes, and bold expeditions.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":120,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Kendal Mountain Festival Cinematic Tour 2027","instanceDates":"21 February-21 February","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"285201ABRRLGTKDPVSPLCMLPSSTNLKVVV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-21T20:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-21T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-21T20:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-21T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_Distributor":"Kendal Mountain Film Festival","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Special Events","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"120","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_Genre1":"Documentary","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_DirectedBy":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_Year":"","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Kendal Mountain Events returns for another season of adventure and human connection. A handpicked curation of award-winning short films, showcasing breathtaking landscapes, and bold expeditions. The experience doesn’t stop on-screen. A live talk from an inspiring speaker fresh from their adventures brings these stories to life, with exclusive insights from the people behind the journeys. Local representatives take to the stage to share how they are opening up the outdoors to their community, sharing opportunities for you to get involved.\r\n\r\nPlease note: This will be a completely new programme of films and will not duplicate the February Cinematic programme \r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":180,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Kendal Mountain Festival Live Tour 2027","instanceDates":"19 May-19 May","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"285401APJJTPVQTNGBQLRCQTRRQPSBRTK","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-19T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-19T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-05-19T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-19T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_Distributor":"Kendal Mountain Film Festival","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Special Events","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"180","attribute_FilmRating":"12A","attribute_Genre1":"Documentary","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_CastDetails":"","attribute_DirectedBy":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_Year":"","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Set in the Alpine village of Tolzbad, where everyone - man, child and animal - must speak and tread extremely softly in case they cause an avalanche. Sexual repression bubbles over, setting off incestuous love triangles and twisted murder plots. Playing like an extreme melodrama from a bygone age that never existed, Careful has been stunningly remastered in 4K.\r\n\r\n\r\n“Utterly compelling” - Time Out\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":100,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Careful","instanceDates":"16 October-16 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"271201ATQRRKQKSQSBCNQSBMSVRVRDPLT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Paul Cox, Kyle McCulloch, Gosia Dubrowolska","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Canada","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Guy Maddin ","attribute_Distributor":"Films We Like","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"100","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1992","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Following a lockdown, residents of an apartment building battle to survive against a massive, creepy, infestation of deadly spiders. Starring the brilliant Lutz (Red Sonja, Revenge), Crawlers is a little something to make your skin crawl…\r\n“Delivers” - Bleeding Cool News\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":86,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Crawlers","instanceDates":"18 October-18 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"272602AVSPJCKTQPCCHSKBRBDQMLLMPQH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T21:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T21:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Matilda Lutz, Gregg Sulkin","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Angel Gomez Hernandez","attribute_Distributor":"Signature Entertainment","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"86","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"The 17th Century, Kattalin poisons her husband and flees into the deepest and darkest of woods. She strays from the path, and encounters three old women, keen to tell her their stories. Breakthrough Basque folk horror. \r\n\r\n\r\n“Breathtaking” - Terror Weekend\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":87,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Gaua (The Night)","instanceDates":"17 October-17 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"272201ACMSCGCDHQTTJVQMHJVQPCGCDCL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T14:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T13:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T14:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T13:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Yune Nogueiras, Elena Irureta","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Spain","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Paul Urkijo Alijo ","attribute_Distributor":"Filmax","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"87","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2025","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"From the acclaimed Anwar (Satan’s Slaves, Impetigore) comes his latest, a mix of off-kilter comedy, martial arts, punchy politics and very gory horror. If being in a corrupt prison isn’t already deadly enough, an entity is turning the prisoners inside out. \r\n\r\n\r\n“Exhilarating… undeniably entertaining” - Asian Movie Pulse\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":106,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Ghost in the Cell","instanceDates":"17 October-17 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"272601AKMBNJSKQHNSMRNMHHNBSKDNJPG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T18:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T17:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T18:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T17:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Bront Palarae, Abimana Aryasatya","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Indonesia","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Joko Anwar ","attribute_Distributor":"Blue Finch Film Releasing","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"106","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"For everyone who has ever had a bad job, a bad boss, bad hours or bad pay. Grind eviscerates gig work culture with a unique, intertwining anthology.\r\n\r\n\r\n“Gleefully gory” - Screen Anarchy\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":104,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Grind","instanceDates":"15 October-15 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"270801ACJKLTTJJPKHPSDRDSVDJDCKDQQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-15T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-15T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-15T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-15T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Barbara Crampton, Rob Huebel","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Chelsea Stardust, Ed Dougherty, Brea Grant","attribute_Distributor":"Squirrel Park Productions","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"104","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"When a young boy is abducted, his mother learns of a disturbing method to rescue him. However, her husband grows increasingly concerned that the infant she has brought back may not actually be their son. Imposters deftly establishes a strangling claustrophobia interrupted by sudden explosions of violence.\r\n\r\n\r\n“Catches you off guard” - Nightmare on Film Street \r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":99,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Imposters","instanceDates":"16 October-16 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"271601ABQSLCBLKPJNJRHBHNPRJVVRDSD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T18:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T17:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T18:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T17:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Jessica Rothe, Charlie Barnett","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Caleb Phillips","attribute_Distributor":"Blue Finch Film Releasing","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"99","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Playing as a tribute to the late Sam Neill – always a welcome presence and star of so many great genre hits (Dead Calm, Event Horizon, Jurassic Park, the remarkable Possession). Carpenter’s full throttle Lovecraft celebration is among his finest films.\r\n\r\n\r\n“A masterpiece” - Slant Magazine\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":95,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: In The Mouth of Madness","instanceDates":"17 October-17 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"272801AGMVKKSTHQSQGNBVBTLHNVTHDHG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T21:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T20:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-17T21:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-17T20:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Sam Neill, Charlton Heston","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"USA","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"John Carpenter","attribute_Distributor":"Park Circus","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"95","attribute_FilmRating":"15","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"1995","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Q&A With special guest, writer director Taratoa Stappard\r\n\r\nAn impressively rendered Gothic horror; stylish, unsettling and disturbing. A young Māori woman arrives from New Zealand to the Yorkshire estate of an entitled Englishman, and is soon disturbed by nightmarish visions that risk revealing dark secrets. \r\n\r\n\r\n“Exhilarating” - IndieWire\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":89,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Mārama","instanceDates":"16 October-16 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"271801AMPRTMNVVNPDKSCDKLHVKDJNDLL","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T20:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-16T20:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-16T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Ariāna Osborne, Toby Stephens","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"New Zealand","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Taratoa Stappard ","attribute_Distributor":"Vertigo","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"89","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2025","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Hilariously original, deadpan comedy from New Zealand. When a messy millennial underachiever accidentally gets alien-pregnant she must overcome sceptical doctors, a useless baby-daddy, and her oversharing mum.\r\n\r\n\r\n“Sweet, sticky and stomach churning” - Rue Morgue Magazine\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":95,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Mum, I'm Alien Pregnant","instanceDates":"18 October-18 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"273001ABRLQMNRKCMTSPKQVTNJSBQMRMM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T12:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T11:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T12:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T11:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Hannah Lynch, Arlo Green","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"New Zealand","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Thunderlips ","attribute_Distributor":"Blue Finch Film Releasing","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"95","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Airi, a travelling medium, arrives at a remote hotel which is being haunted by a ghost that only ever comes out at night, and becomes determined to discover the reason for the spirit’s strange behaviour. Thrilling homage to classic Japanese and Korean horror cinema.\r\n\r\n\r\n“Builds atmosphere and tension to a truly insane final act” - Roger Ebert\r\n“Visual storytelling at its finest” - Horror Buzz\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":105,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: Never After Dark","instanceDates":"18 October-18 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"273201AKQBSCCMTCSDTNVHJJKRDTSTPVK","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T18:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T17:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-18T18:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-18T17:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_ArtsAndTechnology":false,"attribute_AudioDescribed":false,"attribute_CafeBarEvent":false,"attribute_CastDetails":"Moeka Hoshi, Kento Kaku","attribute_CountryOfOrigin":"Japan","attribute_CreateAndLearn":false,"attribute_DirectedBy":"Dave Boyle ","attribute_Distributor":"Blue Finch Film Releasing","attribute_EventCinema":false,"attribute_FestivalOrSeason":"Mayhem Film Festival 2026","attribute_Film":true,"attribute_FilmDuration":"105","attribute_FilmRating":"18","attribute_Genre1":"Horror","attribute_SpecialGuestEvent":false,"attribute_Year":"2026","attribute_IVRCode":"","attribute_WebImportId":"","attribute_Genre2":"","attribute_Language":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField1":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField2":"","attribute_DotdigitalEventField3":""},{"description":"Trapped inside a deserted tower block, one with a notorious reputation, four friends find themselves cornered and up against a ruthless killer. \r\n\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":95,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Mayhem 2026: No Way Down (UK Premiere)","instanceDates":"15 October-15 October","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"271001ALTLVJRBQLKRVTJLGMDHLTRPQDV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-15T21:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-15T20:15:00Z","las